We're glad to inform that hired Ops official website now features the possibility of self-maintained email change. Also, we have introduced a multi-factor authentication, with additional confirmation administered via one of the following methods:

- email;
- backup email;
- single-use passcodes;
- secret question;
- Google Authenticator.

The email address can only be switched is the multi-factor authentication is on. These measures will improve the Hired Ops accounts security and protect them from hacking. New functions are available in your profile on the official game website.

